        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Woodland%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city sits on Lake Minnetonka shoreline, about 5.9 miles of shoreline.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
